`is a member of the Commonwealth after orders under section 35(2), if` country `has been added` `the Governor in Council has by order added the country` `or deleted` `the Governor in Council has by order deleted the country` MEANS
    IF   `the Governor in Council has by order deleted the country`
    THEN FALSE
    ELSE IF   `the Governor in Council has by order added the country`
